
==== ipl-rcb-rr-2025-04-24 | fee None False | src 'https://www.iplt20.com/'
In the upcoming IPL game, scheduled for April 24 at 10:00AM ET:
If the Royal Challengers Bangalore win, the market will resolve to “Royal Challengers Bangalore”.
If the Rajasthan Royals win, the market will resolve to “Rajasthan Royals”.
If the game is postponed, this market will remain open until the game has been completed.
If the game is canceled entirely, with no make-up game, this market will resolve 50-50.

==== usa-vs-india-cricket-t20-world-cup | fee None False | src ''
This market will resolve to whichever national team wins the ICC Men’s T20 World Cup 2024 match between USA and India, scheduled to begin June 12, 2024, 10:30 AM ET.

If the game is declared tied, abandoned, has "no result", or doesn't finish before June 30, 2024, 11:59 PM ET - this market will resolve 50-50.

